    "garage_strategy": {
      "group": "openings",
      "binding": "specified",
      "invented": true,
      "variants": [
        {
          "id": "alley-loaded-or-set-back",
          "status": "canonical",
          "note": "New Classical's own signature five-part-palladian massing 'solves the garage by turning it into a dependency'; New Urbanist Traditional's own hard constraint (c01) requires alley-loading where an alley exists, or a setback of not less than 20 ft / side-loading otherwise, with street-facing garage doors forbidden outright."
        },
        {
          "id": "attached-street-facing",
          "status": "permitted",
          "note": "Modern Farmhouse's own lineage entry states plainly that it descends from ranch-style for exactly this: 'attached garage on the frontage.' This is named in the family's own texts as an inherited compromise from the production-builder apparatus (via minimal-traditional and neo-eclectic), not as an aspiration -- the same node's own distinguished_from entry against new-urbanist-traditional notes that under a form-based code 'the garage relegation' is enforced and 'produces a visibly better version of the same style,' i.e. the family's own text treats the street-facing garage as the weaker, market-compromised branch rather than as a genuinely equal alternative."
        }
      ],
      "rule": "Two of the family's three members treat the garage as a problem to be solved by relegation -- to an alley, a deep setback, or a subordinate dependency -- and name street-facing garage doors as a categorical failure; the third inherits the ranch's attached, street-facing garage as an unexamined structural holdover from the production-builder apparatus it is otherwise trying to reform. The family does not have one answer; it has an active internal argument about this slot, and that argument is itself worth recording rather than resolving in the family's favour.",
      "confidence": "high",
      "status": "drafted",
      "note": "This is exactly the docs/inheritance.md 'garage_strategy... should be specified on every contemporary buildable variant' case, applied honestly: rather than picking new-classical's and new-urbanist-traditional's answer as canonical and demoting modern-farmhouse-traditional's, both are recorded as real, load-bearing positions the family's own members actually build."
    },
